  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "With the use OCFL we can and should allow access to the past versions of the object even when a direct access returns 410 Gone.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This ticket is to:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Ensure the tombstone response also contains the Link header to the timemap.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Ensure the timemap is accessible when the original resource is deleted.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Ensure the mementos are accessible when the original resource is deleted.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
