  "description": "<p>With the use OCFL we can and should allow access to the past versions of the object even when a direct access returns 410 Gone.</p>\n\n<p>This ticket is to:<br/>\n1. Ensure the tombstone response also contains the Link header to the timemap.<br/>\n2. Ensure the timemap is accessible when the original resource is deleted.<br/>\n3. Ensure the mementos are accessible when the original resource is deleted.</p>",
